# Allow-list: the build context is ONLY what the image needs. Anything not re-included below (local .env files, .venv,
# .git, caches, tests, scripts) never reaches `docker build` -- so a new local file can't leak into an image by accident.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic.ini
!alembic/
!app/

# ...and never these, even inside the re-included folders.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/*.db
**/.env
**/.env.*
